Feature: Performance scenario 1 - Policy Creation

  @Scenario1 @Scenario1.1
  Scenario Outline: Performance Scenario 1.1 - Policy Creation - HO - "<thread>" - "<user>"
    * I have entered test data for test case "CA_001" in excel workbook "QuoteCreationPerformance" in sheet "QuoteCreatorHO" for "HO" LOB
    * I load random user data
    * I am logged in to Pure as "<user>"
    * I create performance execution record ID with defined scenario ID "2"
    And I navigate to quotes page
    * I initiate a new quote
    * I get customer ID, store to DB and return to Policy Info Page
    * I create a new "HO" quote
    * I rate a quote
    * I navigate to underwriting referrals page
    * I accept underwriting referrals
    * I bind a quote
    * I override subjectivities
    * I logout

